{
  "id": 8834821357767,
  "title": "Personalized Deer Silhouettes Forming Heart Outline Comforter",
  "handle": "personalized-deer-silhouettes-forming-heart-outline-comforter-4b181475d7-4b181475d7",
  "body_html": "<p>Wrap yourself in cozy outdoor romance with this personalized deer hunting couple quilt set from Jeminise. Perfect for couples who share a passion for wildlife and the great outdoors, this quilt brings warmth, style, and a touch of personalization to any bedroom setting.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Features a customizable text area to add your own personal touch, romantic saying, or family names.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Wildlife Theme:</strong> Beautifully designed with deer silhouettes forming a heart outline on a camouflage graphic illustration background.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Made from a comfortable blend of 70% cotton and 30% polyester, with a high-quality silk floss filling for lightweight yet cozy warmth in all seasons.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from a range of sizes to suit your needs, including Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (70x80 inches), Queen (80x90 inches), and King (91x102 inches).</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Optional Pillowcases:</strong> Complete your bedding set with an optional matching set of 2 or 4 pillowcases.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> This durable quilt is machine washable in cold water and dries quickly for convenient maintenance.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>70% Cotton, 30% Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Silk Floss</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Deer Couple Hunting</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Hunting, Wildlife, Outdoor Romance</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Animal Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Deer Couple-04</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
